the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move place with *a row* and *a col* is made; known as place.
    the move update with *a thing* is made; known as update.

the fluents are:
    *a row* cell *a col* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a thing* connected *a row* with *a col*; known as connected.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is the owner of *a role*; known as owner.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    blackpath; known as blackpath.
    the move place with *a row* and *a col* is legal; known as legal_place.
    redpath; known as redpath.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a row* adjacent *a col* with *a second row* with *a second col*.
    *a row* is a row.
    *a col* is a col.
    *a thing* is the nextrow of *a second thing*.
    the nextcol of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base hex includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/hex.hrf".

a row adjacent a col with the row with a second col if
    the nextcol of the col is the second col
    and the row is a row.

a row adjacent a col with the row with a second col if
    the nextcol of the second col is the col
    and the row is a row.

a row adjacent a col with a second row with the col if
    the row is the nextrow of the second row
    and the col is a col.

a row adjacent a col with a second row with the col if
    the second row is the nextrow of the row
    and the col is a col.

a row adjacent a col with a second row with a second col if
    the second row is the nextrow of the row
    and the nextcol of the col is the second col.

a row adjacent a col with a second row with a second col if
    the row is the nextrow of the second row
    and the nextcol of the second col is the col.

